{"text":"Our nations are strongest when we uphold the equality of all our people, and that includes our women. Now, you may have noticed I am married to a very strong and talented woman. Michelle is not afraid to speak her mind or tell me when I'm wrong, which happens frequently. And we have two beautiful daughters, so I'm surrounded by smart, strong women. And in raising our girls, we've tried to instill in them basic values, a sense of compassion for others and respect for themselves, and the confidence that they can go as far as their imaginations and abilities will carry them. And as part of Michelle's work as First Lady, she's met with women and girls around the world, including here in India, to let them know that America believes in them, too.","words":[{"text":"Our","start":1.26,"end":1.86},{"text":"nations","start":1.86,"end":2.18},{"text":"are","start":2.18,"end":2.42},{"text":"strongest","start":2.42,"end":2.86},{"text":"when","start":2.86,"end":3.18},{"text":"we","start":3.18,"end":3.34},{"text":"uphold","start":3.34,"end":3.64},{"text":"the","start":3.64,"end":3.8},{"text":"equality","start":3.8,"end":4.22},{"text":"of","start":4.22,"end":4.72},{"text":"all","start":4.72,"end":4.92},{"text":"our","start":4.92,"end":5.1},{"text":"people","start":5.1,"end":5.34,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":5.52,"end":5.68},{"text":"that","start":5.68,"end":5.86},{"text":"includes","start":5.86,"end":6.44},{"text":"our","start":6.44,"end":6.88},{"text":"women","start":6.88,"end":7.1,"punct":"."},{"text":"Now","start":8.96,"end":9.56,"punct":","},{"text":"you","start":12.98,"end":13.22},{"text":"may","start":13.22,"end":13.4},{"text":"have","start":13.4,"end":13.5},{"text":"noticed","start":13.5,"end":13.8},{"text":"I","start":13.8,"end":14.94},{"text":"am","start":14.94,"end":15.08},{"text":"married","start":15.08,"end":15.5},{"text":"to","start":15.5,"end":15.72},{"text":"a","start":15.72,"end":15.92},{"text":"very","start":15.92,"end":16.84},{"text":"strong","start